{"title": "Soul Branding (Condition)", "pageid": 16072, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Soul_Branding_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status properties", "Bugs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Soul_Branding_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Soul_Branding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Soul_Branding_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Soul_Branding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Soul_Branding_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Soul_Branding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soul Branding Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Soul_Branding_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Soul_Branding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/00/Soul_Branding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Soul Branding</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Creature's movement speed is increased by 1.5 m (5 ft), and its next weapon attack deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">2d4 + 1</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage. This condition ends upon landing a successful weapon attack. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">GOB_DROWCOM_BUFF</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CGOB_DROWCOM_BUFF%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CGOB_DROWCOM_BUFF%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/ForceOverhead\" title=\"Status properties/ForceOverhead\">ForceOverhead</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The in-game tooltip states the effect provides a movement speed bonus of 1.5 m (5 ft), but it is actually 5 m (17 ft).</li>\n<li>When applied to a weapon with the <a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a> property, the effect is not lost on hitting an enemy with a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> attack, and remains for the full duration. The damage is still added.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Soul_Branding\">Sources of Soul Branding</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Branding\" title=\"Soul Branding\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Soul_Branding_Icon.webp/30px-Soul_Branding_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Soul_Branding_Icon.webp/45px-Soul_Branding_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Soul_Branding_Icon.webp/60px-Soul_Branding_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soul Branding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Soul_Branding_Icon.webp/30px-Soul_Branding_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6f/Soul_Branding_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Branding\" title=\"Soul Branding\">Soul Branding</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234406\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.059 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1833/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20867/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7181/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.026/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1263186/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   53.524      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   53.524      1 -total\n 56.21%   30.086      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 24.65%   13.194      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 18.02%    9.645      5 Template:Icon_link\n 16.99%    9.091      5 Template:Icon_text\n 16.23%    8.687     24 Template:Trim\n 15.08%    8.070      1 Template:PageSeo\n 12.76%    6.832      3 Template:Template_style\n 10.51%    5.626      1 Template:Condition_sources/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:16072-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714234406 and revision id 342990. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}